      "text": "How to use this before Tuesday practice\n\nWalk boards 1\u21923 out loud (that's the pitch). Boards 4\u21928 are so you can answer\njudges without flipping to code. Board 9 is the demo run-of-show.",
      "originalText": "How to use this before Tuesday practice\n\nWalk boards 1\u21923 out loud (that's the pitch). Boards 4\u21928 are so you can answer\njudges without flipping to code. Board 9 is the demo run-of-show.",
