      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What Rally is not\n\n\u2022 Not Kickstarter for strangers\n\u2022 Not a bridge UI\n\u2022 Not a wallet you install\n\u2022 Not a DAO\n\u2022 Not mainnet / not real money (testnet by design)",
      "originalText": "What Rally is not\n\n\u2022 Not Kickstarter for strangers\n\u2022 Not a bridge UI\n\u2022 Not a wallet you install\n\u2022 Not a DAO\n\u2022 Not mainnet / not real money (testnet by design)",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "re0036",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
