      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Guiding test for every feature: does it make the chain more invisible, and does it make the promise easier to trust?\nRally wins by being the group-money app that happens to be onchain \u2014 never the onchain app that happens to do group money.",
      "originalText": "Guiding test for every feature: does it make the chain more invisible, and does it make the promise easier to trust?\nRally wins by being the group-money app that happens to be onchain \u2014 never the onchain app that happens to do group money.",
