    {
      "id": "te0047",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 190,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 520,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#191122",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "fr0042",
      "index": "a00047",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 732788278,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1982487002,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "GOALS  \u00b7  GoalVault\n0x914e\u20260AB4   Arbitrum Sepolia   Ownable (relayer + owner = deployer)\n\nOne-shot, all-or-nothing.\n\u201cSend the crew to Tokyo \u2014 $2,000 by Friday.\u201d\n\n1. Organizer sets goal + deadline \u2192 one link\n    createCampaign is permissionless\n2. Friends open the link, email-login, chip in USDC\n    from whatever chain they hold it on\n3. Goal hit before deadline \u2192 organizer withdraws\n    one consolidated pot\n   Missed \u2192 every backer reclaims. Escrow tracks\n    {sourceDomain, amount} so refunds can rail home.\n\nStatus: Active \u2192 Succeeded | Failed\nLive: /c/1 (hero) \u00b7 /c/2 (created in-product)",
      "originalText": "GOALS  \u00b7  GoalVault\n0x914e\u20260AB4   Arbitrum Sepolia   Ownable (relayer + owner = deployer)\n\nOne-shot, all-or-nothing.\n\u201cSend the crew to Tokyo \u2014 $2,000 by Friday.\u201d\n\n1. Organizer sets goal + deadline \u2192 one link\n    createCampaign is permissionless\n2. Friends open the link, email-login, chip in USDC\n    from whatever chain they hold it on\n3. Goal hit before deadline \u2192 organizer withdraws\n    one consolidated pot\n   Missed \u2192 every backer reclaims. Escrow tracks\n    {sourceDomain, amount} so refunds can rail home.\n\nStatus: Active \u2192 Succeeded | Failed\nLive: /c/1 (hero) \u00b7 /c/2 (created in-product)",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "re0046",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 16
    },
    {
      "id": "re0048",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 190,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 520,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#191122",
