    {
      "id": "te0049",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 190,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 520,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#191122",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "fr0042",
      "index": "a00049",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1150671234,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 879612940,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "CIRCLES  \u00b7  RotatingVault\n0xdd9b\u20267838   Arbitrum Sepolia   OWNERLESS\n\nThe chit fund / tanda / susu, minus the foreman.\n\n1. Organizer starts a circle: N seats, fixed amount,\n    round length. Each seat gets a signed invite.\n2. Every round, everyone chips in the same amount.\n    When the round fills, ONE member takes the pot.\n    Turn rotates until everyone has had theirs.\n3. Anyone misses? Circle stops. Everyone still\n    holding a deposit is refunded. Automatically.\n\nNo admin key can touch the money.\nLive: /circle/1 (rotating) \u00b7 /circle/2 (broke + refunded)",
      "originalText": "CIRCLES  \u00b7  RotatingVault\n0xdd9b\u20267838   Arbitrum Sepolia   OWNERLESS\n\nThe chit fund / tanda / susu, minus the foreman.\n\n1. Organizer starts a circle: N seats, fixed amount,\n    round length. Each seat gets a signed invite.\n2. Every round, everyone chips in the same amount.\n    When the round fills, ONE member takes the pot.\n    Turn rotates until everyone has had theirs.\n3. Anyone misses? Circle stops. Everyone still\n    holding a deposit is refunded. Automatically.\n\nNo admin key can touch the money.\nLive: /circle/1 (rotating) \u00b7 /circle/2 (broke + refunded)",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "re0048",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 16
    },
