      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The switch on the landing (Goals \u00b7 Circles) is the product, not a nav item.\nYou are showing judges that the same promise has two faces \u2014 a trip pot and a savings committee \u2014 and that the refund rail is real in both.",
      "originalText": "The switch on the landing (Goals \u00b7 Circles) is the product, not a nav item.\nYou are showing judges that the same promise has two faces \u2014 a trip pot and a savings committee \u2014 and that the refund rail is real in both.",
