      "text": "DEST  \u00b7  Arbitrum Sepolia\n\n3. receiveMessage(msg, att)\n   Anyone can submit.\n   Rally\u2019s relayer does.\n\nUSDC mints into GoalVault.\nThen recordContribution\nattributes (campaign, backer,\nsourceDomain).",
