      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Why the bar is multi-colored\n\nEach contribution stores sourceDomain on-chain.\nThe UI paints a band per chain:\n\n  Base        #3b82f6\n  Arbitrum    #22d3ee\n  Optimism    #fb7185\n  Solana      #a855f7   (docs only, not live yet)\n\n\u201cHalf of this came from Base\u201d is readable\nin the mercury. That is the pitch, made visual.",
      "originalText": "Why the bar is multi-colored\n\nEach contribution stores sourceDomain on-chain.\nThe UI paints a band per chain:\n\n  Base        #3b82f6\n  Arbitrum    #22d3ee\n  Optimism    #fb7185\n  Solana      #a855f7   (docs only, not live yet)\n\n\u201cHalf of this came from Base\u201d is readable\nin the mercury. That is the pitch, made visual.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "re0101",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 16
    },
    {
      "id": "re0103",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 400,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#191122",
