    },
    {
      "id": "te0104",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 400,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#191122",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "fr0091",
      "index": "a00104",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 106090224,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 541627164,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Two chip-in paths (Goals)\n\nA. Backer-funded (honest / preferred)\n   Their 7702 wallet holds USDC \u2192 they burn.\n   Relayer only relays mint + record.\n\nB. Empty fresh email wallet\n   Dispenser: GitHub-gated faucet \u2192 Base USDC\n   into THEIR wallet, then path A.\n   Kill switch: DISPENSER_FALLBACK=relayer\n   restores the old \u201crelayer fronts the burn.\u201d\n\nRelayer USDC is finite. Cap $10 / chip-in.\nNever pretend B is the user paying.",
      "originalText": "Two chip-in paths (Goals)\n\nA. Backer-funded (honest / preferred)\n   Their 7702 wallet holds USDC \u2192 they burn.\n   Relayer only relays mint + record.\n\nB. Empty fresh email wallet\n   Dispenser: GitHub-gated faucet \u2192 Base USDC\n   into THEIR wallet, then path A.\n   Kill switch: DISPENSER_FALLBACK=relayer\n   restores the old \u201crelayer fronts the burn.\u201d\n\nRelayer USDC is finite. Cap $10 / chip-in.\nNever pretend B is the user paying.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "re0103",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 16
    },
