    {
      "id": "te0130",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 540,
      "width": 740,
      "height": 380,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#191122",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "fr0105",
      "index": "a00130",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1944775884,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 297455896,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Relayer trust \u2014 say this if asked, do not lead with it\n\nCCTP mint arrives at the vault with no \u201cwho sent it.\u201d\nSo a permissioned relayer calls recordContribution.\n\nBOUNDED by an on-chain invariant:\n  token.balanceOf(vault)  \u2265  totalEscrowed   always\n\nRelayer can mis-attribute a real deposit\n(wrong backer / wrong sourceDomain).\nRelayer CANNOT:\n  \u2022 conjure funds  \u2022 inflate raised past USDC in the vault\n  \u2022 drain the contract  \u2022 steal a refund\n\nMainnet path: CCTP v2 hook carries (campaignId, backer).",
      "originalText": "Relayer trust \u2014 say this if asked, do not lead with it\n\nCCTP mint arrives at the vault with no \u201cwho sent it.\u201d\nSo a permissioned relayer calls recordContribution.\n\nBOUNDED by an on-chain invariant:\n  token.balanceOf(vault)  \u2265  totalEscrowed   always\n\nRelayer can mis-attribute a real deposit\n(wrong backer / wrong sourceDomain).\nRelayer CANNOT:\n  \u2022 conjure funds  \u2022 inflate raised past USDC in the vault\n  \u2022 drain the contract  \u2022 steal a refund\n\nMainnet path: CCTP v2 hook carries (campaignId, backer).",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "re0129",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 15
    },
    {
      "id": "re0131",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 820,
      "y": 540,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 380,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#191122",
      "backgroundColor": "#e6f8ee",
