      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "te0132",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 820,
      "y": 540,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 380,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#191122",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "fr0105",
      "index": "a00132",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 203665475,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 852467032,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Refund rail\n\nSame-chain: backer calls refund, USDC on Arb.\nCross-chain: relayer (or backer) calls\nrefundCrossChain \u2192 CCTP burn back to\nthe stored sourceDomain.\n\nThis is why sourceDomain is stored per contribution.\nThe bar\u2019s colors are not decoration \u2014 they are\nthe refund routing table.\n\n86 Foundry tests \u00b7 invariant_solvency\nAudited twice \u00b7 0 Crit / High / Med",
      "originalText": "Refund rail\n\nSame-chain: backer calls refund, USDC on Arb.\nCross-chain: relayer (or backer) calls\nrefundCrossChain \u2192 CCTP burn back to\nthe stored sourceDomain.\n\nThis is why sourceDomain is stored per contribution.\nThe bar\u2019s colors are not decoration \u2014 they are\nthe refund routing table.\n\n86 Foundry tests \u00b7 invariant_solvency\nAudited twice \u00b7 0 Crit / High / Med",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "re0131",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 15
    },
