      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Deployer / relayer\n0x6A63\u202693B1\n\nGoalVault owner + relayer\nPays gas to mint + record\nDemo-circle organizer\nHolds Arb + Base ETH,\nArb USDC (~7.5)\n\nCannot steal Goals pots\n(withdraw = beneficiary)\nCannot touch Circles pots\n(ownerless vault)",
      "originalText": "Deployer / relayer\n0x6A63\u202693B1\n\nGoalVault owner + relayer\nPays gas to mint + record\nDemo-circle organizer\nHolds Arb + Base ETH,\nArb USDC (~7.5)\n\nCannot steal Goals pots\n(withdraw = beneficiary)\nCannot touch Circles pots\n(ownerless vault)",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
