      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What you do not need to open\n\n\u2022 Private keys (never paste, never screenshare)\n\u2022 Railway dashboard\n\u2022 Foundry / forge (86 tests already green)\n\u2022 ARBISCAN_API_KEY (verify-only)\n\nWhat you DO pre-open Friday\n\u2022 Landing  rally-production-94cc.up.railway.app\n\u2022 /c/1  /circle/1  /circle/2\n\u2022 Burn tx \u00b7 mint tx \u00b7 refund tx \u00b7 both contracts",
      "originalText": "What you do not need to open\n\n\u2022 Private keys (never paste, never screenshare)\n\u2022 Railway dashboard\n\u2022 Foundry / forge (86 tests already green)\n\u2022 ARBISCAN_API_KEY (verify-only)\n\nWhat you DO pre-open Friday\n\u2022 Landing  rally-production-94cc.up.railway.app\n\u2022 /c/1  /circle/1  /circle/2\n\u2022 Burn tx \u00b7 mint tx \u00b7 refund tx \u00b7 both contracts",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
