      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The 60-second version (if they cut you)\n\n\u201cOne link. A bar that fills itself from every chain. It pays out together, or refunds everyone \u2014 automatically. That\u2019s Rally.\u201d\n1. Landing is a live escrow. Every color is a different chain. Nobody bridged.   2. Email, amount, You\u2019re in \u2726 \u2014 burned on Base, attested ~10s, minted on Arb.\n3. Switch to Circles. /circle/1 rotating live. /circle/2 we broke on purpose; the refund tx is already public.\n4. The primitive PayPal abandoned, plus the world\u2019s largest informal instrument, with a pot nobody can walk off with.",
      "originalText": "The 60-second version (if they cut you)\n\n\u201cOne link. A bar that fills itself from every chain. It pays out together, or refunds everyone \u2014 automatically. That\u2019s Rally.\u201d\n1. Landing is a live escrow. Every color is a different chain. Nobody bridged.   2. Email, amount, You\u2019re in \u2726 \u2014 burned on Base, attested ~10s, minted on Arb.\n3. Switch to Circles. /circle/1 rotating live. /circle/2 we broke on purpose; the refund tx is already public.\n4. The primitive PayPal abandoned, plus the world\u2019s largest informal instrument, with a pot nobody can walk off with.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "re0202",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
